<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill price target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill price target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it reaffirmed a buy rating on Merrill Lynch and Co Inc and raised the one-year price target to $70 from $55.</p>
<p>-- said raised the price target since Merrill Lynch had already reached the $55 target.</p>
<p>-- Merrill gained two to 57-1/2.</p>
</text>
